    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107570" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερθετ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>superlative,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑ. εἶδος τῆς συγκρίσεως</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Stat.</u>
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				Rh.
				7(1).430
			</span></i> W.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑ.</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.136
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Asp.
				<u>in EN</u>
				110.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cael.</u>
				713.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ὄνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					143.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				167.26
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				<i>in the superlative,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					9.619
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				12.814
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				83
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dilatory,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.269
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελληταί.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>requiring</i> or <i>causing delay,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				182.17
			</span></i>, al.</div>
